  "description": "Buildonomics Outthink. Outbuild. Outlast. Buildonomics is a two-phase competition combining business knowledge, technical skills, and entrepreneurial thinking . Phase 1 – Biz-Quiz A competitive quiz covering: Startups & Entrepreneurship Finance & Economics Marketing Technology & Innovation Global Industry Trends Quiz performance determines priority for problem statement selection. Phase 2 – 24-Hour Hackathon Build innovative solutions across: FinTech HealthTech EdTech SustainTech Smart Governance Teams will ideate, build, test, and pitch their solutions before a panel of judges. Timeline: Day 1: Check-in → Quiz → Problem Statement Selection → Hackathon Kickoff → Review Rounds Day 2: Mid-point Evaluation → Shortlisting → Final Sprint → Final Pitch & Demo Team Size: 3–5 members Evaluation: Innovation & Creativity – 20% Technical Implementation – 25% Problem-Solution Fit – 15% Business Viability & Scalability – 15% UX & Design – 10% Final Pitch & Presentation – 15%",
