    "details": "<p>Buildonomics</p>\n<p><strong>Outthink. Outbuild. Outlast.</strong></p>\n<p>Buildonomics is a two-phase competition combining <strong>business knowledge, technical skills, and entrepreneurial thinking</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Phase 1 &ndash; Biz-Quiz</strong></p>\n<p>A competitive quiz covering:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Startups &amp; Entrepreneurship</li>\n<li>Finance &amp; Economics</li>\n<li>Marketing</li>\n<li>Technology &amp; Innovation</li>\n<li>Global Industry Trends</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Quiz performance determines priority for problem statement selection.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Phase 2 &ndash; 24-Hour Hackathon</strong></p>\n<p>Build innovative solutions across:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>FinTech</li>\n<li>HealthTech</li>\n<li>EdTech</li>\n<li>SustainTech</li>\n<li>Smart Governance</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Teams will <strong>ideate, build, test, and pitch</strong> their solutions before a panel of judges.</p>\n<p><strong>Timeline:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Day 1:</strong> Check-in &rarr; Quiz &rarr; Problem Statement Selection &rarr; Hackathon Kickoff &rarr; Review Rounds<br /><strong>Day 2:</strong> Mid-point Evaluation &rarr; Shortlisting &rarr; Final Sprint &rarr; Final Pitch &amp; Demo</p>\n<p><strong>Team Size: </strong><strong>3&ndash;5 members</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Evaluation:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Innovation &amp; Creativity &ndash; 20%</li>\n<li>Technical Implementation &ndash; 25%</li>\n<li>Problem-Solution Fit &ndash; 15%</li>\n<li>Business Viability &amp; Scalability &ndash; 15%</li>\n<li>UX &amp; Design &ndash; 10%</li>\n<li>Final Pitch &amp; Presentation &ndash; 15%</li>\n</ul>",
    "end_date": "2026-09-14T23:59:00+05:30",
